"==============================\n"
"Spreadsheet Dashboard Academic\n"
"==============================\n"
"\n"
"This module adds the \"Seguimiento de Facturación\" (billing tracking) spreadsheet dashboard, in a new \"Academic\" dashboard group.\n"
"\n"
"The dashboard shows:\n"
"\n"
"* the number of students, parents and inactive students, and students by current course and level (initial, primary, secondary);\n"
"* subscriptions by recurring plan for each level;\n"
"* monthly invoicing and monthly payments, and monthly collections for the current year;\n"
"* the list of recurring plans.\n"
"\n"
"The dashboard is shared with the Academic manager group.\n"
"\n"
"Installation\n"
"============\n"
"\n"
"To install this module, you need to:\n"
"\n"
"#. Only need to install the module\n"
"\n"
"Configuration\n"
"=============\n"
"\n"
"To configure this module, you need to:\n"
"\n"
"#. Nothing to configure\n"
"\n"
"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"To use this module, you need to:\n"
"\n"
"#. Go to Dashboards > Academic > Seguimiento de Facturación.\n"
"\n"
".. image:: https://odoo-community.org/website/image/ir.attachment/5784_f2813bd/datas\n"
"   :alt: Try me on Runbot\n"
"   :target: http://runbot.adhoc.com.ar/\n"
"\n"
